#. さてと、今日はこれからどうしよう…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, so...what should I do today?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ、時間はあるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's still time left in the day.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じっとしている気分じゃない。
#. どこかに行ってみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't feel like just sitting here. Maybe I'll go\n"
"explore.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…お腹が減った気がする…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess I'm feeling a little hungry.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>夜時間になる前に、
#. 何か食べておこうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better get something to eat before it's nighttime.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 食堂にでも…行ってみるか…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I should head to the dining hall then, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物、壊してやりたいけど…
#. 壊したら大変な事になるんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd love to just smash the stupid thing, but who knows\n"
"what would happen to me if I did...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…
#. ボクらを監視してるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They've been using these cameras to watch us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>落ち着かないってレベルじゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think I might actually be getting used to it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの死から…目を背けちゃいけない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let myself turn away from Sayaka's death...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの為にも…
#. ボク自身の為にもだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For Sayaka...and for myself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この鉄板…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This metal plate..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな鉄板で閉じ込められてるなんて…
#. まさに悪夢だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To be sealed in by a huge slab of metal... It's like\n"
"I'm stuck in a bad dream.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この鉄板…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This metal plate..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな鉄板で閉じ込められてるなんて…
#. まさに悪夢だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To be sealed in by a huge slab of metal... It's like\n"
"I'm stuck in a bad dream.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the same notepad from before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、ここの備え付けってことかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess the school must have given one to each of\n"
"us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>粘着テープクリーナーだ。
#. 桑田クンが…これを使って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leon used this lint roller when he...he...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>未だにビニールの包装がされてる。
#. まだ未開封の新品だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now, it still hasn't been opened.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まぁ、工具セットなんて使う事はないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think I need it right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>枕が変わると眠れない、なんて話を聞くけど…
#. ボクはそうじゃなかったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I've heard some people can't sleep if they don't have\n"
"the pillow they're used to. Guess I'm not like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0026 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0027 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have some time, so maybe I should take a little\n"
"rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゴミ箱をのぞき込むって、
#. なんか…無意味すぎる気が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looking inside the trash can feels\n"
"somehow...meaningless.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙は、はがしたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tore the paper off the wall, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの内容を思い出すだけでも、
#. 嫌な気分になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just remembering what it said still makes me feel\n"
"queasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しのある机だ。
#. 特に隠しているものはない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the same desk with the same few drawers. I don't\n"
"see anything hidden in it anywhere.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0033 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0034 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
